tation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n</div>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>Liver transplantation is a treatment option for acute liver failure, end-stage liver disease (cirrhosis) with permanent damage, and certain liver cancers. For many patients it can offer the possibility of returning to a more active life. MedLuxLife arranges the assessment at our partner hospital, coordinates the paperwork and travel for patient and family, and stays [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 2, "featured_media": 0, "parent": 259, "menu_order": 23, "comment_status": "closed", "ping_status": "closed", "template": "page-with-title", "meta": {"footnotes": ""}, "permalink_template": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/%pagename%/", "generated_slug": "liver-transplant-clinic", "class_list": ["post-496", "page", "type-page", "status-publish", "hentry"], "_links": {"self": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/496", "targetHints": {"allow": ["GET", "POST", "PUT", "PATCH", "DELETE"]}}], "collection": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages"}], "about": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/types/page"}], "author": [{